OL,3,CMayor promises to breathe new life
OL,4,Cinto high streets
OL,6,FThe Mayor of Greater Manchester, Bev
OL,7,FCraig, has promised to breathe new
OL,8,Flife into local high streets and
OL,9,Frestore community pride with a #20
OL,10,Fmillion fund.
OL,12,FThe Good Growth High Streets Fund will
OL,13,Fbe made available to local businesses,
OL,14,Fbusiness groups, and voluntary and
OL,15,Fcommunity organisations across Greater
OL,16,FManchester to take forward ideas for
OL,17,Fimproving their high street.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
