CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786432687
OL,3,CMayor promises to breathe new life
OL,4,Cinto high streets
OL,6,FBev Craig said: "Our high streets are
OL,7,Fthe beating hearts of our communities
OL,8,Fand people want to feel pride about
OL,9,Fwhere they live.
OL,11,F"They are rightly worried and
OL,12,Ffrustrated when they see derelict
OL,13,Fpubs, boarded up shops and dodgy
OL,14,Foperators, and independent traders
OL,15,Fmoving away.
OL,17,F"They want to see practical support
OL,18,Ffor lcoal businesses now, and that's
OL,19,Fwhy I'm taking action."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
