OL,3,CMayor promises to breathe new life
OL,4,Cinto high streets
OL,6,FBev Craig spoke about the importance
OL,7,Fof high streets on a visit to Middleton
OL,9,FThe new Mayor kicked off her second
OL,10,Fweek in the job with a visit to
OL,11,FMiddleton town centre where she spoke
OL,12,Fto business owners and shoppers about
OL,13,Fhow their high street could be
OL,14,Frevitalised.
OL,16,FJohn David, who owns Joocool Grocery
OL,17,Fstore, told the Mayor that small
OL,18,Fbusinesses needed support so that
OL,19,F"more goods could be available for
OL,20,Fpeople to come to the town centre".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786432687
OL,3,CMayor promises to breathe new life
OL,4,Cinto high streets
OL,6,F"If not they will be going from
OL,7,FMiddleton to the city centre. But if a
OL,8,Flot of things are available here, they
OL,9,Fdon't have to go there," he added.
OL,11,FMiddleton's post office has recently
OL,12,Fclosed and there are no remaining bank
OL,13,Fbanches in the town centre.
OL,15,FCraig said she has been working with
OL,16,Fthe local council and community
OL,17,Fbusinesses to get a new post office
OL,18,Fopened, and she's setting up a
OL,19,Froundtable with financiai institutions
OL,20,Fto discuss getting banks back into
OL,21,Ftown centres.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786432687
OL,3,CMayor promises to breathe new life
OL,4,Cinto high streets
OL,6,F"We went to get banks," she said. "It
OL,7,Fhelps local traders, it helps
OL,8,Fcommunities that aren't digitally
OL,9,Fenabled and ready to go, but it's also
OL,10,Fa sense of pride and a sign of the
OL,11,Ftimes, restoring trust back into high
OL,12,Fstreets."
OL,14,FBusiness owners in Middleton told Bev
OL,15,FCraig what they thought shoud be done
OL,16,Fto improve their high street
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
