FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786432687
OL,3,CMayor promises to breathe new life
OL,4,Cinto high streets
OL,6,FJack Howard, the landlord of the
OL,7,FBritannia Inn, told the mayor traders
OL,8,Fin the town centre were hoping to
OL,9,Fimprove the appearance of the high
OL,10,Fstreet.
OL,12,F"We've got a local business forum
OL,13,Fgoing on, we're all getitng together,
OL,14,Fthere's a big community spirit at the
OL,15,Fmoment and hopefully there's some
OL,16,Ffunding coming our way ..... so we can
OL,17,Fpaint these buildings and get flowers
OL,18,Fin the flower beds," he said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786432687
OL,3,CMayor promises to breathe new life
OL,4,Cinto high streets
OL,6,F"Luckily, Bev's on board with that
OL,7,Fsort of thing, and she's seen today
OL,8,Fthat with a little bit of effort we
OL,9,Fcan make things better."
OL,11,FThe #20 million Good Growth High
OL,12,FStreets Fund will open for
OL,13,Fapplications later in the year, with
OL,14,Fthe Mayor promising to back ideas that
OL,15,Fcan make a real difference to good
OL,16,Feconomic growth and restore local
OL,17,Fpride.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
